        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CSD2008SMTSBR, Solid Brass Half Circle Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Half Moon Door Pull is a great addition to storefront doors as well as other commercial applications. Its modern design makes it an attractive handle for residential front doors as well. The Solid Brass Half Circle Door Handle is 8 inches long with 5 inch center to center mounting. It is packaged as one half circle door pull with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions CSD2008SMTSBR Cascade Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CSD02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262332\"><b>First Impressions CSD2008SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
