                "title": "Half Moon Door Pull, Half Pair",
                "description": "The Half Moon Door Pull is a great addition to storefront doors as well as other commercial applications. Its modern design makes it an attractive handle for residential front doors as well. The Solid Brass Half Circle Door Handle is 8 inches long with 5 inch center to center mounting. It is packaged as one half circle door pull with mounting hardware.",
